  "details": "When changing a parameter through the Parameter Driver, that is changed by another menu control the Control shows the playing animation (rotating arrows), but I have to click the option twice in order to deactivate it.\nSteps to reproduce:\nAnimation Layer 1: \n- Empty State, enabled with Param1 = 0\n- some animation, enabled with Param1 = 1\n- Empty state, enabled with Param1 = 2 - This state gets a VRCAvatarParameterDriver, which changes Param1 to 1.\nNow make a menu with two controls (Param1 to 1, Param1 to 2) as toggles.\nStart the game\nHit the Param2 button and see how it changes the Param1 button visually, but requires two clicks on the Param1 button to deactivate\n\nEDIT: this was done all on the FX layer, not sure if that matters",
